My first ascension was with the +2 magicbane.  My second, I had the +7
Frostbrand, and alternated between them.  A wizard's primary weapons
should be Magic Missile, the Finger, and possibly Cone of Cold / Fireball
(extremely powerful in the right circumstances.)

As a wizard, you can do a lot more damage with the finger, or Magic
Missile (something like 16d6 if you're xl 30) than with any wielded
weapon.  There are very few creatures in the game that resist both, so you
can kill pretty much anything quickly.  The few creatures that may resist
both spells are: Archons, A's with reflection, priests with MR.

I'd prefer having the +7 Frostbrand to the +2 Magicbane for the endgame,
but it's still quite doable as a Wizard with just MB.



